before HTTP) — rerun on lighter load gave the clean table.\n\nPASS/FAIL TABLE (16 rows, 67 checks):\nRow 1 application/json+hang (bodyIdleTimeout)     8/8 PASS (exit1, 3 POSTs, totalPOSTs=3, Body read timed out, budget exhausted)\nRow 2 SSE+hang (chunkTimeout)                     5/5 PASS (SSE read timed out, ERROR, 3 POSTs)\nRow 3 no-response (headerTimeout)                 5/5 PASS (Provider response headers timed out, budget, 3 POSTs)\nRow 4 healthy application/json                    4/4 PASS (exit0, 1 POST, content delivered)\nRow 5 healthy SSE                                 3/3 PASS (exit0, no ERROR, 1 POST)\nRow 6 slow-but-legit non-SSE (5s gaps)            4/4 PASS (completes, no abort, 1 POST)\nRow 6b slow non-SSE never completes               4/4 PASS (bounded total-timeout marker, 1 POST)\nRow 7 PER_REQUEST isolation                       3/3 PASS (retry on req2 completes, >=2 POSTs)\nRow 8 bodyIdleTimeout sensitivity (2000 vs 4000)  3/3 PASS (20s < 33s)\nRow 9 STALLED 15s chunks, idle=10000              4/4 PASS (Body read timed out, 3 POSTs)\nRow 9b PARSE_STALL (turn-level guard)             5/5 PASS (Turn stalled, ERROR, 3 POSTs)\nRow 10a gzip healthy non-SSE                      3/3 PASS (no ZlibError, content delivered)\nRow 10b gzip non-SSE hang                         3/3 PASS (abort marker, 3 POSTs)\nRow 11 non-chat passthrough                       1/1 PASS\nRow 13 aggregate: every hang row >=1 ERROR        1/1 PASS (7/7)\nRow 14 aggregate: POST-count invariant            6/6 PASS\nRow 16 static acceptance (v2 copy + routing)      5/5 PASS\nTOTAL: 67/67 PASS, 0 FAIL.\n\nNo product findings — every product behavior the matrix gates (bodyIdleTimeout non-SSE idle, SSE chunk timeout, headerTimeout, bounded 3-POST retry budget, total-timeout cap, turn-level guard, gzip, per-request isolation) is verified working. Harness-only fixes; committed to this branch. Task 3 (install) intentionally NOT done.","created_at":"2026-08-08T18:58:42.213040316Z","kind